window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>As night gathers, chaos rains down on the city of Ashwood like acid. The New Order of Void Weavers led by Isaac Moreau are gaining strength, but the shield separating the world of humans from the things hungrily waiting for their turn at the batting plate is fractured and weak, and repairing it is no small task. Meanwhile Alice Werner, the supernatural bounty hunter, has her hands full with an increasing number of contracts, and as Ashwood starts simmering toward a boiling point, it's only a matter of time until something gives and all hell breaks loose. </p><p><i>Night and Chaos</i> is the third and final book in the Half-Lich Trilogy of urban fantasy suspense novels. Fans of this series will not want to miss this final, thrilling installment. </p>"; 
